ec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T09:07:42-08:00","id":423017,"title":"","content":"Well, Ian Watson posted in the comments about it. &quot;Rich was watching the polls when $128K was reached. I stopped the poll about a minute later. If Rich says Forsaken by Rome won, it won. It's a difference of four votes as-is, so it's entirely plausible.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T09:22:39-08:00","id":423031,"title":"","content":"Yay! Day made.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T09:24:12-08:00","id":423032,"title":"","content":"Awesome, guys and gals. I was not expecting this, though I hoped for it. I was also of hoping someone would drop out of their add-on backing so I could jump on it and get some words added to existing ages (Bowery Dogs would have been the perfect place to have City gifts, which everyone seems to want). Vikings AND Rome, can't complain about getting everything we were offered, two great time periods to round out our Dark Eras presence and finally get us some werewolves in ancient days.","signature":"","edited":{"us